[
  {
    "screen": 1,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "朋友托您办的事，没办成，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 2,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "那个电话，",
    "chars": 5
  },
  {
    "screen": 3,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "您是不是拖了好几天不敢打？",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 4,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "人情这东西，",
    "chars": 6
  },
  {
    "screen": 5,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "靠的是平时一点点往来处出来",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 6,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "的——",
    "chars": 3
  },
  {
    "screen": 7,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "《中国式人情世故》里讲的，",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 8,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "就是这个理。",
    "chars": 6
  },
  {
    "screen": 9,
    "line_id": "A03",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "托人办事，我自己就记住三步：",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 10,
    "line_id": "A03",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "早回、说透、给路。",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 11,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "早回：有结果当天就说，",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 12,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "别等人家追着问；您越躲，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 13,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "对方心里越凉。",
    "chars": 7
  },
  {
    "screen": 14,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "说透：卡在哪一步，",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 15,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "明明白白讲，不推给别人，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 16,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "也不夸海口说下次一定。",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 17,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "给路：这条路走不通，",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 18,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "帮他想想还有没有别的门路，",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 19,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "哪怕只是提个醒，",
    "chars": 8
  },
  {
    "screen": 20,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "也比一句「没办法」强。",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 21,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "办成办不成是能力，",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 22,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "肯不肯及时回话是人品。",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 23,
    "line_id": "A08",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这本书我放在主页橱窗里了，",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 24,
    "line_id": "A08",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "点开我主页，商品橱窗里就有。",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 25,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "办不成的事，",
    "chars": 6
  },
  {
    "screen": 26,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "您一般怎么跟人开口？",
    "chars": 10
  }
]